# Shrine: sand-themed 5x5 room, healing potion NW, lever center (spawn on activate).
VAULT vault_shrine_5x5
WEIGHT 1
MIN_DISTANCE_FROM_PLAYER_START 6
ORIGIN 2 2
TILES .=SandTheme:32;W=SandTheme:50
MAP
WWWWW
W...W
W...W
W...W
WW.WW
ENDMAP
ITEM healing_potion AT 1 3
INTERACTABLE lever_shrine AT 2 2
END
